        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47, Welcome to Dubai. You are here to deal with a crew after incident they have caused. They were drunk on a night out and while being drunk have killed big organization son and have got away with it. Owner of the organization have found out who they are and want revenge by killing them in any way. Owner is worrying that they will kill someone else again in the future if they are drunk again so make sure that doesn&apos;t happen. Good Luck 47.",
